---
source: tests/explain_snapshots.rs
description: "-- 4-way chain in the worst possible textual order; filter at the far end\nSELECT c_name, p_name\nFROM part, customer, lineitem, orders\nWHERE p_partkey = l_partkey\n  AND o_orderkey = l_orderkey\n  AND c_custkey = o_custkey\n  AND c_acctbal < 0.0"
expression: rendered
---
ProjectPhys [#1.1, #0.1]
  HashJoinPhys on=[#0.0 = #2.1] (build, probe)
    ProjectPhys [#0.0, #0.1]
      ScanPhys #0
    HashJoinPhys on=[#2.0 = #3.0] (build, probe)
      HashJoinPhys on=[#1.0 = #3.1] (build, probe)
        FilterPhys (#1.4 < 0.0)
          ProjectPhys [#1.0, #1.1, #1.4]
            ScanPhys #1
        ProjectPhys [#3.0, #3.1]
          ScanPhys #3
      ProjectPhys [#2.0, #2.1]
        ScanPhys #2
